## Description

Stripe dashboards are boring. So I built mine as a forest.  Every tree is a real subscriber. Big customers grow into big trees. When someone is about to cancel, their tree turns orange.  When they churn, the tree dies. When a payment comes in, it rains. You can scroll back in https://t.co/n1cDY50Kfe

